### 1. Generate Token
POST {{hosturl}}/jwt-generate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
x-tenant-id: {{xTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "USER_ID",
  "roles": ["DEFAULT_ROLE"],
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "name": "User Name"
}

### 2. Verify Token
POST {{hosturl}}/jwt-verify
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
x-tenant-id: {{xTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{authToken}}"
}

### 3. Regenerate Token
GET {{hosturl}}/jwt-regenerate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
x-tenant-id: {{xTenantId}}
